# This PC's own settings for Amethyst. Copy to .env (never committed) and fill in.

# npm run release: a fine-grained GitHub token for the repo Amethyst.exe only, contents read and write.
# The installed app needs no token: it reads the public releases.
# Only the release step reads this line; the app itself skips it, so no agent or terminal it starts ever sees it.
GH_TOKEN=
